      "contextBefore": "Due to Core Image’s coordinate system mismatch with [`UIKit`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/library/archive/releasenotes/General/WhatsNewIniOS/Articles/iOS5.html#//apple_ref/doc/uid/TP30915195-SW41), this filtering approach may yield unexpected results when displayed in a [`UIImageView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIImageView) with [`contentMode`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIView/contentMode-swift.property).",
