      "normalizedSource": "If you are displaying or processing your image primarily as a [`CGImage`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreGraphics/CGImage) or [`UIImage`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIImage), with no additional Core Image application, consider cropping in Core Graphics using the [`cropping(to:)`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreGraphics/CGImage/cropping(to:)) function to save processing overhead from conversion of images to [`CIImage`](ciimage.md).",
